    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "3 Bed Cottage of c 135 m2 on c 0.65 mature Grounds with Metal Sheds/Workshops PLUS 2 Large Mobile Homes\r\nOffers in Excess of €315,000\r\n\r\nRose Cottage is a charming 3-bedroom country cottage extending to c. 135 m2 (c. 1,450 ft2) and set on c. 0.65 acres of mature, landscaped grounds in a convenient rural location. The property offers excellent space both inside and out, with gated entrances, a gravel driveway, generous yard area, lawn, feature fountain, mature hedging, shrubs and trees. In addition to the residence, the grounds accommodate an extra-large metal shed/workshop, a wooden storage shed and two large mobile homes, providing valuable additional space and flexibility for storage, hobbies, guests or other uses. Ideally positioned close to forest walks, the property is just 5 minutes’ drive from the commercial centre of Wellingtonbridge, approximately 15 minutes from Wexford Town and only 40 minutes from Rosslare Europort.\r\nEXCELLENT VALUE AND GREAT POTENTIAL!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch\t -\t2.34m x 2.29m PVC entrance door with sidelights, tile flooring, wood panel ceiling and large window. \r\nInner Hallway\t       -\t3.91m x 3.91m carpet flooring and wood panel ceiling.\r\nLiving Room    \t-\t4.04m x 3.61m carpet flooring, open plan to sun lounge, recessed lighting, wood & metal fireplace, hot press and access to kitchen.\r\nKitchen / Dining \t-\t3.66m x 3.05m tile flooring, recessed lighting, raised panel solid Oak kitchen with laminate counter tops and tile splash back, electric hob and oven with overhead extraction fan, integrated fridge/freezer and access to back hall/utility room.\r\nSun Lounge\t\t -\t4.72m x 3.25m carpet flooring, open plan to living room, vaulted wood panelled ceiling and French doors to mature garden. \r\nBack Hall/Utility\t -\t9.14m x 1.27m tile flooring, built-in cabinets with laminate countertops, stainless sink unit, washer/dryer hook-up, walk-in & fully shelved pantry (1.37m x 1.07m) plus 2nd storage area (1.17m x 0.71m) and access to guest WC.\r\nGuest WC\t\t-\t1.72m x 0.84m tile flooring, WC and window.\r\nStorage Area\t        -\t3.00m x 2.90m tile flooring and built-in storage units.\r\nBoiler Room\t\t-\t2.29m x 1.27m tile flooring.\r\nHobby Room\t       -\t4.88m x 3.71m carpet flooring. \r\nBathroom\t\t-\t2.60m x 2.39m tile flooring, half tiled walls, bathtub with hand-held shower, separate enclosed electric shower unit, WC and WHB. \r\nBedroom 1\t\t-\t3.58m x 2.23m carpet flooring.\r\nTop Landing\t\t-\t3.81m x 0.91m carpet flooring.\r\nBedroom 2\t\t-\t3.73m x 3.50m carpet flooring and built-in wardrobes.\r\nBedroom 3 \t\t-\t3.50m x 2.39m carpet flooring. \r\nShower Room\t       -\t2.54m x 2.34m fully tiled, large wet shower area with electric Triton T90 shower, WC and WHB."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "3 Bed Country Cottage of c 135 m2 (ca 1,450 ft2) in great location.\r\nPVC double glazed windows, white fascia & soffit and slate roof.\r\nExterior insulation recently completed.\r\nEntry way with piers and metal gates.\r\nKerbed and gravel driveway with ample parking.\r\nConcrete slabs surrounding house. \r\nC 0.65 acres with mature hedges and lawn area, shrubs and trees.\r\nX-Large metal shed/workshop and wooden storage shed.\r\n2 large mobile homes.\r\nOnly 5 minutes drive to the commercial centre of Wellingtonbridge.\r\nC 15 minutes to Wexford, Rosslare Europort only c 40 minutes’ drive."
      },
